    "body": ">In the “Show outline“ output from the HTML checker and in the other 3 or so tools (h5o, @gsnedders outliner, some other one I can’t remember the details of) that implement the outline algorithm. (True, as we know, none of those are browsers.)\r\n\r\nAll of these are tools that show developers how the outline algorithm works in theory, thus they re-inforce the false assertion that the outline algorithm actually has some practical real world effect. There function is to contribute to the fiction, unfortunately.",
